    "detailed_description": "Measurement Problem is a first person puzzle game where the player must traverse a facility trapped between dimensions. <br><strong>Switch</strong> between the 'white' and 'black' dimensions using special pads to solve <strong>platforming puzzles</strong> as well as <strong>logical puzzles</strong>, and progress through the game. <br>As you progress with the guide of Catherine, the narrator,  you will unlock multiple <strong>abilities</strong> that will give you more freedom to explore but will also increase the difficulty of the puzzles.",
